        {
          "record_index": 5,
          "source_time_s": 5.100000075995922,
          "video_time_s": 5.050000075995922,
          "text": "Maintain lane and accelerate because the signal is green, the intersection is clear, and the right‑lane change cannot start within the junction; prepare for a right‑lane merge after clearing it.",
