          "text": "Change to the right lane and begin slowing due to approaching a signalized T-intersection with right-lane guidance, then prepare to stop for the red light ahead; no conflicting moving agents are present, only static boundaries (curb, lane lines, crosswalk) to clear after the merge.",
          "instruction": "Take E Gage Ave."
